{"_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"content": "A Serious Image Problem", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Investigating the Rumor", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 5, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 4, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.3", "type": "level"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": "Explains customs and appropriate behavior at work and in different countries, using a wider range of expressions and formulas.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific  information and  aspects of attitude and   intention in   conversations, texts or   presentations about   the communicative   functions related to   this level.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific  information and  aspects of attitude and   intention in   conversations, texts or   presentations about   the communicative   functions related to   this level.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific  information and  aspects of attitude and   intention in   conversations, texts or   presentations about   the communicative   functions related to   this level.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific  information and  aspects of attitude and   intention in   conversations, texts or   presentations about   the communicative   functions related to   this level.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific  information and  aspects of attitude and   intention in   conversations, texts or   presentations about   the communicative   functions related to   this level.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific  information and  aspects of attitude and   intention in   conversations, texts or   presentations about   the communicative   functions related to   this level.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific  information and  aspects of attitude and   intention in   conversations, texts or   presentations about   the communicative   functions related to   this level.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific  information and  aspects of attitude and   intention in   conversations, texts or   presentations about   the communicative   functions related to   this level.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Making and Responding to Polite Requests", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use the modals <span class=\"italic\">can</span>, <span class=\"italic\">could</span> and <span class=\"italic\">would</span> to politely ask someone to do something for you.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "The structure is:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Can/Could/Would + you + verb", "type": "text"}, {"content": "For example: </br><span class=\"italic\">Could you get me a drink?</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You can also use phrases like:</br><span class=\"italic\">Could you do me a favor?</br>Can I ask you for a favor?</br>Could you do something for me?", "type": "text"}, {"content": "To respond to a polite request you can say:</br><span class=\"italic\">It would be my pleasure. </br>Of course. </br>Absolutely. </br>I'd be happy help you.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\">I'm sorry. I can't. </br> I would love to, but ...</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <span class=\\\"strong\\\">Modal Verb</span>\\\"}\",\"\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Polite request</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\"><span class=\\\"italic\\\">can</span></span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"polite\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Can you do that for me?</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\"><span class=\\\"italic\\\">could</span></span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"more polite\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Could you do me a huge favor?</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\"><span class=\\\"italic\\\">would</span></span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"most polite\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Would you please get me a drink?</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "Would you do me a favor?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Could I ask you to help me with something?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Can you do that for me?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Could you also do me a huge favor?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "It would be my pleasure. ", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Gerunds and Infinitives", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "A <span class=\"strong\">gerund</span> is a verb ending with -ing (doing).</br> An<span class=\"strong\"> infinitive</span> is to + verb (to do). <br></br>There are rules about which verbs you can use with gerunds and which verbs you can use with infinitives.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Verbs commonly followed by a gerund include verbs that express<span class=\"strong\"> likes/dislikes:</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<ul><li>like <li>love<li> enjoy <li>dislike<li> hate<li> mind</ul>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Example: </br><span class=\"italic\"> Would you<span class=\"strong\"> mind getting</span> us a drink?</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<ul><li><span class=\"italic\">like/love/hate</span> can also be followed by an Infinitive</ul>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Some other verbs that are followed by a gerund:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<ul><li>anticipate<li> consider<li> delay <li>complete<li> involve<li> suggest<li> risk <li>regret</ul>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You use gerunds after prepositions: </br> <span class=\"italic\">Farmani's company <span class=\"strong\">relies on employing </span>child labor.</span> </br><span class=\"italic\"> He was<span class=\"strong\"> accused of telling </span> lies about his business. </span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "These are some verbs that are followed by an infinitive:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<ul><li>hope <li>seem <li>need <li>manage <li>appear<li> deserve<li> expect<li> ask <li>happen</ul>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Example: </br> <span class=\"italic\">I <span class=\"strong\">manage to mix</span> business with pleasure</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You use infinitives after adjectives.  </br>Example:</br><span class=\"italic\"> I'd be <span class=\"strong\">happy to help </span>you. I was never <span class=\"strong\">able to mind </span>my own business.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I enjoy drinking and chatting.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "You deserve to drink something cold in this hot weather.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "I didn't expect to see you in Brazil so soon. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "I'll work on getting the truth. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "The rumour is that Farmani's agreed to outsource his labor.", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "business or pleasure", "type": "name"}, {"content": "for work or enjoyment, personal happiness", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Did you happen to come here for business or pleasure?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le04ob05aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "These are words you use to talk about jobs and work.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "mix business with pleasure", "type": "name"}, {"content": "combine work and fun", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: When I travel abroad, I manage to mix business with pleasure.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le04ob05aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "urgent", "type": "name"}, {"content": "very important", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I regret to inform you that it is urgent business. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le04ob05aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to mind your own business", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to not ask someone private questions", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I'm never able to mind my own business.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le04ob05aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to investigate", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to look for information on a subject", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I need someone to investigate the business practices of a clothing company. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le04ob05aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "business practices", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a set of working methods", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I feel like their business practices are not ethical.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le04ob05aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "labor ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "work", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Farmani has agreed to outsource his labor. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le04ob05aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to be closely connected to ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to have a close relationship ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: He's the owner and appears to be closely connected to this. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le04ob05aud08", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I ask for and respond to favors.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I list things that I need.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I ask my partner for a favor.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I agree or refuse to help my partner.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Write down 5 things that you need or need done.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Think of a polite way to ask your partner to do these things for you.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Take turns with your partner asking for a favor and letting your partner ask you for a favor.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Respond to your partner's request by agreeing or politely refusing to help.", "type": "text"}]}, {"content": "engenn8le04ob05re1img01.jpg ", "type": "background_image"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"_data": [], "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "id": 0, "template_override": 1}, {"id": 1, "contents": [{"value": {"audiosrc": "engenn8le04ob05re2aud01", "images": [{"image": "engenn8le04ob05re2img01.jpg", "id": 0, "text": "", "time": "0"}, {"image": "engenn8le04ob05re2img01.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Ferdinand</span>: Paulo! Great to see you! How are things?\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Paulo</span>: Good. Hey ... would you do me a favor?\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Ferdinand</span>: It would be my pleasure.\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Paulo</span>: Would you mind getting us a drink? I enjoy drinking and chatting.\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Ferdinand</span>: No worries. You deserve to drink something cold in this hot weather. Could I get us beers?\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Paulo</span>: Sure.  So, I didn't expect to see you in Brazil so soon. Did you happen to come here for business or pleasure?", "time": "100"}, {"image": "engenn8le04ob05re2img05.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Ferdinand</span>: When I travel abroad, I manage to mix business with pleasure. This time I regret to inform you that it is urgent business. Could I ask you to help me with something? What's your schedule like these days?\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Paulo</span>: Busy! But you know me! Never able to mind my own business ... I'd be happy to help you.\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Ferdinand</span>: I need someone to investigate the business practices of a clothing company - Holly's. Can you do that for me?\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Paulo</span>: Absolutely.", "time": "28000"}, {"image": "engenn8le04ob05re2img06.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Ferdinand</span>: Would you consider doing me a huge favor? I need you to look up Farmani. He's the owner and appears to be closely connected to this.\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Paulo</span>: What's your connection?\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Ferdinand</span>: Polygon - the company I work for - was hired to promote their business. The rumor is that Farmani's agreed to outsource his labor and it relies on employing child labor.\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Paulo</span>: Wow. What are the details?\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Ferdinand</span>: Only a rumor. I'm asking you to get to the truth. Would it be too much trouble for you to get some background on Farmani's business practices in other areas?\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Paulo</span>: For sure. I'll work on getting to the bottom of this.", "time": "59000"}], "coverimg": "engenn8le04ob05re2img01.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "audio", "title": ""}], "exercises": [{"id": 0, "template_override": 1, "stimuli_ids": [0], "img_path": "", "type": "WLC", "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": " I can ask for and respond to favors.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can talk about jobs and work.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can talk about my attitudes  toward an action.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " When have you asked a friend or family member to do you a favor?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " When someone does you a favor, how to you repay them?", "type": "Free Header Item"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"correct_feedback": "Correct", "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}], "allowed_attempts": 2}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": "Ask your partner:", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": "It's time to ask for a favor!", "type": "free_type_text_area"}], "questions": []}, {"id": 1, "template_override": 1, "stimuli_ids": [1], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": " Ferdinand needs Paulo to <span class=\"tool-tip\" id=\"tip_1_0\">get to the bottom of it</span>.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Content", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"correct_feedback": "Correct!", "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}], "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}], "allowed_attempts": 2}, "type": "feedback"}, {"type": "learning_skills"